ADDITIONAL DISCLAIMER (applies to all code here, and especially to the smart
contracts under `contracts/` and the scripts under `scripts/`)
================================================================================

NO FEE, NO SERVICE, NO CUSTODY. This software is published free of charge and
is not operated as a paid service. It is NON-CUSTODIAL: the authors never hold
your private keys, never take custody of your funds or assets, and never move
your money. Everything the on-chain contracts do is public and verifiable on a
block explorer. Because there is no approval step and no custody, the software
cannot reach anything in your wallet beyond the single transaction you yourself
sign and send.

USE ENTIRELY AT YOUR OWN RISK. On-chain transactions are IRREVERSIBLE. Mints can
fail (sold out, not live, allowlist-gated, price changed, or contract-specific
reverts) and spent gas is NOT refunded. Smart-contract software can contain bugs;
you are responsible for reviewing it before use.

NOT AUDITED unless a specific deployment states otherwise. The reference contracts
here are provided for study and testing; do not deploy them to mainnet or route
real value through them without an independent professional security audit and
your own testing. See `SKILL.md` / `README.md` for the current status.

YOUR COMPLIANCE, YOUR RESPONSIBILITY. Some tooling here can mint more than one
item per wallet by using multiple addresses. Whether doing so complies with a
given NFT project's rules, a marketplace's terms of service, or the laws and
regulations that apply to you is entirely YOUR responsibility to determine. The
authors make no representation that any particular use is permitted.

NOT FINANCIAL, INVESTMENT, OR LEGAL ADVICE. Nothing here is advice of any kind.

TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, THE AUTHORS ARE NOT LIABLE FOR ANY LOSS
OF FUNDS, ASSETS, OPPORTUNITY, OR DATA ARISING FROM THE USE OF THIS SOFTWARE.

